    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/dbc9bb47a9b05aa1aeb609db306f4057.poster.avif?t=1716422916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/dbc9bb47a9b05aa1aeb609db306f4057.webm?t=1716422916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e8d50b8b77af02e6bc6168e4cf006bda.avif?t=1716422916\" /></div><br>Play solo or party with friends in this cute, cooperative combination of tower defense and beat 'em up action! Travel through time, leap through levels, quickly construct trusty towers, and battle against wave after wave of zany enemies!<br><br><strong>Will you become a master of Chrono-Fu and save the world from evil?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Play as adorable, humble heroes! <i>(Custodian, Cook, Gardener, Fixer, Deliverer, Nurse)</i></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Bash baddies, build towers and battle bosses in three unique times in history!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Accelerate and slow the flow of time in each level to achieve maximum victory!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Unlock an arsenal of stylish shoes, wacky weapons, powerful pets and beverage boosts! </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Loveable, light-hearted and fast-paced fun for all ages and skill levels!</ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Keyboard support for 1 player.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Controller support for 1-4 players.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>(at least one controller required for local multiplayer)</ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/679e732c5cc9727baffb14d587399e52.avif?t=1716422916\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/60f1421c8912eff9a3dde23224899a43.poster.avif?t=1716422916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/60f1421c8912eff9a3dde23224899a43.webm?t=1716422916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/dbc9bb47a9b05aa1aeb609db306f4057.poster.avif?t=1716422916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/dbc9bb47a9b05aa1aeb609db306f4057.webm?t=1716422916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e8d50b8b77af02e6bc6168e4cf006bda.avif?t=1716422916\" /></div><br>Play solo or party with friends in this cute, cooperative combination of tower defense and beat 'em up action! Travel through time, leap through levels, quickly construct trusty towers, and battle against wave after wave of zany enemies!<br><br><strong>Will you become a master of Chrono-Fu and save the world from evil?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Play as adorable, humble heroes! <i>(Custodian, Cook, Gardener, Fixer, Deliverer, Nurse)</i></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Bash baddies, build towers and battle bosses in three unique times in history!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Accelerate and slow the flow of time in each level to achieve maximum victory!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Unlock an arsenal of stylish shoes, wacky weapons, powerful pets and beverage boosts! </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Loveable, light-hearted and fast-paced fun for all ages and skill levels!</ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Keyboard support for 1 player.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>Controller support for 1-4 players.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/e514b2004c517a0a8e93195baa8acb92.webp?t=1716422916\" /></div>(at least one controller required for local multiplayer)</ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/679e732c5cc9727baffb14d587399e52.avif?t=1716422916\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/60f1421c8912eff9a3dde23224899a43.poster.avif?t=1716422916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428300/extras/60f1421c8912eff9a3dde23224899a43.webm?t=1716422916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "ChronoDojo is a cute, cooperative tower defense beat 'em up game in which humble heroes travel time to bash, build and save the world! Who among you is hero enough to learn Chrono-Fu and battle evil across time?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c5 Reasons Why You Should be Excited to Play ChronoDojo: ChronoDojo is a mishmash of different genres that you don\u2019t normally see in the same game....there are mini-games to play, pets to collect, weapons to unlock, and plenty more. It\u2019s a carnival of happy nonsense, and we got swept up in it straight away.\u201d<br>Gamezebo<br>",
